## S4. ALPHA-3 CLI GATE MAPPING

```yaml
G1_GGUF_RUNTIME:  "hace brain replay certify" + "hace brain model verify qwen2.5-0.5b.gguf"
G2_SINGLE_LRO:    "hace brain run --model ... --lora coding.lro --prompt hello"
G3_MULTI_LRO:     "hace brain lora stack" -> 3x adapters deterministic
G4_ZES_ENFORCE:   "hace brain lora verify tampered.lro" -> HardReject
G5_ADAPTER_REG:   "hace brain lora list" + attach/detach no model reload
G6_KV_FUSION:     "hace brain bench lora" -> speedup > 3x
G7_CLI_CERT:      all P0-P3 non-stub output

p0_minimum:
  commands: [model.inspect, model.verify, run]
  wiring:   [main.rs fix, BrainModule->BrainCli, ModelExecutor->GgufLoader real]
  est:      2-4h focused CTO work
```

---

## S5. ERRORS

```yaml
BrainCliError::ModelNotFound{path}:    exit 1
BrainCliError::SealRejected{reason}:   exit 2
BrainCliError::InferenceFailed{msg}:   exit 3
BrainCliError::GoldenMismatch{op,err}: exit 4
BrainCliError::KernelNotReady:         exit 5  # canary for stub detection in CI
```

---

## S6. CTO EXECUTION ORDER

```yaml
step_1: main.rs    -- Replace bypass with Artisan::parse()+dispatcher    30min
step_2: rr/cli     -- Add CommandFamily::Brain + BRAIN_ACTIONS            20min
step_3: cli Cargo  -- Add hace-brain-cli dep                              5min
step_4: cmd/brain  -- BrainArgs -> BrainCommand subcommand enum           45min
step_5: brain Cargo -- Add brain-runtime + fem-hacedle deps               10min
step_6: executor   -- ModelExecutor::inspect/verify -> GgufLoader REAL    2-3h
step_7: executor   -- LoraExecutor::verify -> LroParser+ZesVerifier       2h

total: 6-8h
alpha3_cli_ready_after: step_6
```
